sequenceDiagram
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as grid-operator<br/>9090/TCP metrics
    participant Peer as Peer grid-operator<br/>7946/UDP SWIM
    participant PeerSig as Peer Signals<br/>9091/TCP mTLS
    participant Backend as Inference Backend<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant OverlaySync as overlay-sync<br/>Sidecar
    participant Volume as emptyDir Volume
    participant Praxis as Praxis Gateway

    Note over K8sAPI,Praxis: Flow 1 — Routing Overlay Generation

    K8sAPI->>Operator: CRD watch events (GridNetwork, GridSite,<br/>InferenceProvider, AgentToolProvider)<br/>HTTPS / TLS / ServiceAccount token
    Peer->>Operator: SWIM gossip membership<br/>7946/UDP / AES-256-GCM / Shared key
    PeerSig->>Operator: Provider signal metrics<br/>9091/TCP / HTTPS / mTLS site cert
    Operator->>Backend: Health probe + metrics scrape<br/>HTTP/HTTPS / Bearer token
    Backend-->>Operator: Health status + metrics
    Note over Operator: Score providers via<br/>noMetrics / queueDepth / kvCachePressure
    Note over Operator: Merge CRDT state<br/>LWW registers + OR-Sets + G-Counters
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Write routing overlay ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS / TLS / ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI->>OverlaySync: ConfigMap watch notification<br/>HTTPS / TLS / ServiceAccount token
    Note over OverlaySync: Validate content-addressed envelope<br/>(network, gateway, namespace scope)
    OverlaySync->>Volume: Atomic file write<br/>routing-overlay.json
    Praxis->>Volume: Hot-reload overlay<br/>File I/O (no restart)

    Note over K8sAPI,Praxis: Flow 2 — Site Enrollment

    participant Admin as Grid Admin
    participant Enroll as Enrollment Server<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP TLS

    Admin->>Enroll: POST /v1alpha1/enrollmenttokens<br/>HTTPS / K8s TokenReview + SAR
    Enroll->>PG: Store enrollment token<br/>5432/TCP / TLS / Client cert
    Note over Admin: Distribute token to new site

    participant NewSite as New Site Operator

    NewSite->>Enroll: POST /v1alpha1/enrollments<br/>HTTPS / One-time token + CSR
    Enroll->>PG: Record enrollment, consume token<br/>5432/TCP / TLS
    Enroll-->>NewSite: Signed site certificate + CA bundle<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+
    Note over NewSite: Configure mTLS identity<br/>Join SWIM mesh

    Note over K8sAPI,Praxis: Flow 3 — Identity Rotation

    NewSite->>Enroll: POST /v1alpha1/rotations<br/>HTTPS / mTLS client cert
    Enroll->>PG: Update identity record<br/>5432/TCP / TLS
    Enroll-->>NewSite: New signed certificate<br/>HTTPS / TLS 1.2+
